'''Roads of Torment''' (まどいの魔道路, ''Madoi no Madōro'', '''Confusing Wicked Road''') is the 15th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 64th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Half of this sub-chapter is very or decently difficult ([[Pulling Hair]], [[Lord's Lecture]], and [[Total Myopia]]), while the other half is bearable.

{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

